rKWhc4T1pX3NL_U6k3kFTQKL9Q5TQ-bAHU3yM6xnCzdgrorQENsxX6eox2Dv2QSr3lGtZj2A2klwDVAWWBaUpiiOFt0It8E5tfaK-7rPSapvix28a81UsMOh_au5VD02xwT5jEcRUrZ8eYUOgB0zjj\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgOMf1b0m3MGXLPFUNkXBUQQ9P6nnwTeZGyO5qioarKWhc4T1pX3NL_U6k3kFTQKL9Q5TQ-bAHU3yM6xnCzdgrorQENsxX6eox2Dv2QSr3lGtZj2A2klwDVAWWBaUpiiOFt0It8E5tfaK-7rPSapvix28a81UsMOh_au5VD02xwT5jEcRUrZ8eYUOgB0zjj=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgXZemGF8W8hx8z2JiWcGdGRzHCqHFToswxkR7FUvFcCFMkzPoaxdh1Sm34OOIL1czjT_dKgu-mY-3dgBG2dbK1QrvrjYP209jfcWGLijn0aFVucurX2_qALQUCUjsf7QNZRgswQQsqhfRZRdmbOZa1Eiiz3s26K34AVIzp18102fcQCRv5vJ11ziI0s3mK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgXZemGF8W8hx8z2JiWcGdGRzHCqHFToswxkR7FUvFcCFMkzPoaxdh1Sm34OOIL1czjT_dKgu-mY-3dgBG2dbK1QrvrjYP209jfcWGLijn0aFVucurX2_qALQUCUjsf7QNZRgswQQsqhfRZRdmbOZa1Eiiz3s26K34AVIzp18102fcQCRv5vJ11ziI0s3mK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiYDyqYJhLS5E1NqxY88wcWIHmQQuACwDkZzFhNqlR5fk8I4b93wEGEUWquJOmE3Kh1j24PMxyWv9Mi9g47IdIyJqMPkUYFAt3QA-WB7NCmmQ_YMjomqc6D_FLZ74bz4gfLkzYR2nj3xhUn3p5v3SfftzEU5UJpYsz2pVQ8ygbacBpq0T9oNUX_S7vcXGbJ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiYDyqYJhLS5E1NqxY88wcWIHmQQuACwDkZzFhNqlR5fk8I4b93wEGEUWquJOmE3Kh1j24PMxyWv9Mi9g47IdIyJqMPkUYFAt3QA-WB7NCmmQ_YMjomqc6D_FLZ74bz4gfLkzYR2nj3xhUn3p5v3SfftzEU5UJpYsz2pVQ8ygbacBpq0T9oNUX_S7vcXGbJ=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></span></div></div></div></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">細漢熟sāi ê tsit條歌「菝仔蓮霧、王梨西瓜lóng有……」，ē記得熱天時仔有青lìng-lìng ê鳳凰木，有紅kì-kì ê花開kah滿滿是。細漢天真ê歲月，心涼脾土開，囡仔kòng-kòng大，阮阿媽講：瘦猴gâu suh水，濟囝餓死爸。</span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>細漢ê時tsūn，朋友交陪無閒tshih-tshih，同學厝邊蹛sio倚，挽菅芒、ng-ko̍k雞、 踢銅管、跳索仔，舞豬舞狗，啥mih齣頭to有，時常是鬧熱滾滾。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Hit當時上時行--ê就是布袋戲，逐家lóng看kah tsiok入迷。逐工逐家緊beh看黃俊雄布袋戲ê史艷文，koh有內山做大水ê流杉（劉三），iáu-koh有怪老子、哈買兩齒，mā有〈廣東花〉所唱ê歌詞：「金sih-sih ê高貴目鏡，紅色ê馬靴……」，iáu有萬惡ê罪魁藏鏡人，hit當時是轟動武林、驚動萬教，緊張、緊張、刺激、刺激。M̄-koh後--來國民政府減少電視台播送台語ê節目，講布袋戲hōo學生走學、工人moo-hui……，就是無愛hōo lán講台語，tsiok gê-siâu、拖屎連。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Hit當時阮tsit班有一位轉學--來ê外省仔同學，蹛tī鐵路局宿舍ê紅門院。伊生做kuân-kuân--ā緣投緣投，逐工lóng穿插真整齊，但是hām阮講話bē投機。Hit當時踮tī學校ài講華語，若講台語ài罰錢。講著錢tse就是天大地大ê代誌，無啥mih代誌比因為罰錢無金kâm仔糖thang食khah重要。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>放學規陣厝邊仝路隊ê同學，kā伊圍--起-來，講：「你若去kā老師tâu講，阮有講台語，害阮hông罰錢，阮就kā你舂。」真正hōo逐家bē堪得氣，jiàu-pê仔欠拍，一改了後就乖--ah，m̄敢tshi̍h-tshn̍gh。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Iáu-koh有一改放學ê時tsūn，外省仔同學踏著寶珠ê鞋仔，害寶珠險險跋倒，伊也lóng無會失禮。暗頭仔圍牆紅門外，一陣無三塊豆腐kuân ê國小三年仔學生，làu人來抗議。紅門外口逐家nih跤尾，huah「林宇亨出--來！出--來！……」Hit-tsūn逐家布袋戲看濟--ah，行俠作義（hîng-kiap tsok-gī）是日常。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>阮母--à huan咐阮去學校讀冊，ài聽老師ê話，tio̍h-ài知影囡仔人有耳無喙。放學tńg到厝，母--à問阮講：「今仔日老師教啥mi̍h？」阮回答講：「老師講人若無讀冊ē親像『瞎子』。」「Ha̋nn！Siat-tsuh？」「母--à！M̄是，講若無讀冊ē變tshenn-mê仔。」Tse也是阮細漢學習雙聲道ê開始。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>外媽教阮講：「草仔枝ē kenn倒人」、「一枝草一點露」、「緊事khuann辦」、「順風sak倒牆」……。阮母--à唱伊細漢ê囡仔歌「桃太郎さん、桃太郎さん……」，koh講「公冶長，公冶長，南山虎咬羊，你pun肉，我pun腸」ê故事hōo阮聽。阮爸爸是放烏色曲盤，放送北管ê歌曲mā叫阮聽，阮kâm甜but-but ê金kâm仔糖恬恬仔聽，tse是細漢上美好ê記持。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>年尾寒--來ê時tsūn，「阿門」有紅卵thang食，逐个囡仔lóng真歡喜，教會koh有唱歌hām表演thang看，但是阮tsit陣囡仔也是真苦惱，阮無錢beh按怎？M̄敢去鬥鬧熱……後--來阮逐家就想通--ah，若是奉獻袋仔傳到阮tsia，阮手伸--入-去koh伸--出-來就好--ah。Hennh--lah！就án-ne阮規陣大面神mā鑽--入-去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>阮學校邊--a有一條溪，hia ê樹仔跤有一頂人無愛ê眠床，阮逐家想講kā拖來做船仔一定真趣味，就合力拖到溪邊想beh kò船仔，險險仔發生危險。結果，beh暗仔，規陣母--à藤條、秀梳仔lóng tshuân便便，連洗身軀水mā lóng hiânn好，經驗豐富準備洗身軀拍囡仔。厝邊隔壁規陣囡仔，tio̍h驚mà-mà-háu：「阮後擺m̄敢--ah！」規陣母--à用siau--ê 、用摃--ê、用bu̍t--ê，tia̍p kah金sih-sih，拍kah歪腰無一个làu-kau--去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>隔tńg工早起，逐家beh去學校讀冊ê時tsūn，規陣囡仔phí頭青目腫恬tsih-tsih，頭lê-lê悽慘落魄，無一个kioh-siàu好。啊！Tshit-thô ê青春少年時，是難忘ê記持。</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" width=\"340\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-Ejolqe